WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
Hello everybody. My name is Markiplier and welcome back to Tattletail.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.520
Now if you notice by the eggs collected,

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:09.980
someone said it was very, very important to the story to get all the gift eggs,

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:17.960
so I went back and I played through up until this point again to try to make sure I get all of the eggs possible.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:23.100
Now, I wanted to talk about why this game is scary

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:28.940
and it is--to me at least. I'm not going to say this game is scary to everybody, for - for me this game is terrifying.

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:33.000
And I find that it's mostly because

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.060
it's set up a lot of stuff.

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:36.880
Given that I play through it just again,

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:41.500
I realized that it set up a lot of things that didn't immediately happen.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:45.160
It - it alluded to the possibility that there were going to be scares

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.040
and that there was unsettlingly creepy things going on in this game,

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:50.160
but it didn't get to it right away.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:54.580
It wasn't until the third night that anything really scary actually happened.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:58.760
Not even really scary, scary things happened, but it wasn't until...

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:02.220
the third night that something threatening actually happened.

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:06.920
So I'm on the lookout for even more eggs by the way.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:11.580
Seventeen? Seventeen?! Did I miss some?

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:13.020
There's no way I could've missed some!

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:14.680
I was so close!

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:16.300
I was so careful.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.300
I might've missed one; I have no idea. *Creepy Tattletail talking in the distance*

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.980
I've been tryin' my best.

